I don't think, nethack is a particularly difficult game.  I used to 
think it is difficult when I started; I had no idea, how one could 
*ever* ascend.  But once you know the game well enough, you may still 
die an unavoidable - more or less - death at the beginning, but once you 
have mastered that stage and are well into the game, you can (almost) 
always find a solution to all problems that turn up.  It is a matter of 
patience but also of inventiveness, I would say, because there are so 
many different ways of reaching a goal.  When you are in a strategic 
impasse, you can save the game and think for a few days about a solution.

